### Get employees
POST {{baseApiPath}}/employees/search
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Find employees by searchInput (personnelNumber)
# The term goes in the body, not a ?searchInput=... query parameter - see ADR-0057 (GDPR gap G25).
POST {{baseApiPath}}/employees/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "searchInput": "02000"
}

### Find employees by searchInput (firstname)
POST {{baseApiPath}}/employees/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "searchInput": "fahr"
}

### Find employees by searchInput (lastname)
POST {{baseApiPath}}/employees/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "searchInput": "Beifahrer"
}

### Save new employee
POST {{baseApiPath}}/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "personnelNumber": "12345",
  "firstname": "first",
  "lastname": "last"
}

### Update employee 1
PUT {{baseApiPath}}/employees/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "personnelNumber": "12345",
  "firstname": "first-updated",
  "lastname": "last-updated"
}

### Export employee data (GDPR takeout) - for an employee with no linked user account
GET {{baseApiPath}}/employees/1/export
